{"2402470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World of Anterra", "steam_appid": 2402470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/9d552a56a2f206c8fabc04eea4dc08b9.poster.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/9d552a56a2f206c8fabc04eea4dc08b9.webm?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/9d552a56a2f206c8fabc04eea4dc08b9.mp4?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About 81monkeys</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World of Anterra is a deeply personal project for Stephane and his team at 81monkeys. They first started working on their dream game back in 2018, but little did they know how difficult this road was going to be. Despite facing financial ruin on many occasions, Stephane has managed to keep his team together through pandemic related funding issues, work-for-hire partners going under, crushing financial sacrifices, bill collectors, a risk-averse industry, and personal hardships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to learn more, Stephane's &quot;Founder's Journals&quot; chronicle the struggles and triumphs that helped bring World of Anterra to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community of dreamers!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8531e865727c53d479da34b1300c217e.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% human made.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World of Anterra is a handcrafted open-world role playing adventure; featuring a non-linear story and quests, deep progression systems, fast and exciting grid-based combat, and rich lore, all wrapped in a satisfying and tactile interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/44356e81a9ea63c67065afb781b4ac7e.poster.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/44356e81a9ea63c67065afb781b4ac7e.webm?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/44356e81a9ea63c67065afb781b4ac7e.mp4?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/75b5831740cff98c7ed9c4330fb939c1.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/52d757c89289f2f899f05493558a4c0f.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of Anterra by asking questions, interacting with the environment, reading books and exploring the world. Learn about the history of magic, and the ancient races. Sneak into crypts, caves and houses and discover secrets hidden in containers or behind breakable objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/Steam_-_Map_Scale_4.GIF?t=1787685220\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8638f6f8c4a35831ff76b67477add4b8.poster.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8638f6f8c4a35831ff76b67477add4b8.webm?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8638f6f8c4a35831ff76b67477add4b8.mp4?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/75b5831740cff98c7ed9c4330fb939c1.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/c87c84a01ed6f897466ea60f19738033.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anterra is a dangerous and unpredictable world, beset by unstable magics, dangerous factions, and tortured creatures... but you will find moments of solitude and comfort amidst the chaos. Rest in friendly taverns, set up camps to sleep the darkness away, or take a moment to sit on a log and enjoy the sights and sounds of a living world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/d445acc8b590d115ec0dce0fbd644a7d.poster.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/d445acc8b590d115ec0dce0fbd644a7d.webm?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/d445acc8b590d115ec0dce0fbd644a7d.mp4?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/75b5831740cff98c7ed9c4330fb939c1.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/d363fa48b384f7bfaf7939d09696abfa.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat blends quick-time actions with grid-based strategy. The UI is streamlined so simple encounters can be blasted through with ease. While skill and strategy is needed to conquer the game's more challenging foes; combining skill-based mechanics for attacking and defending, with special abilities, magic spells, crafted items, and strategic movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/ca549ae820f088280cf2ea847ed1c91a.poster.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/ca549ae820f088280cf2ea847ed1c91a.webm?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/ca549ae820f088280cf2ea847ed1c91a.mp4?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/75b5831740cff98c7ed9c4330fb939c1.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/7feea15be00b2149918192bb9cde9074.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World of Anterra blends hand-animated assets with player customization. Build your party members with a vast array of items and gear and see it all come to life with a custom animation layering system. This system also applies to NPCs and creatures creating a truly diverse and unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/cc99290cdff5bd8004c27613b08dbc3f.poster.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/cc99290cdff5bd8004c27613b08dbc3f.webm?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/cc99290cdff5bd8004c27613b08dbc3f.mp4?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/75b5831740cff98c7ed9c4330fb939c1.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/7d55fde03fbd725130423dc35f1cdc74.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World of Anterra comes to life with a custom real-time lighting engine, beautiful water shaders, dynamic weather, day-night cycles, and wonderful special effects that thoughtfully combine hand-animated sprites with procedural effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8321b19109ccb1b20c2d873b3e09527f.poster.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8321b19109ccb1b20c2d873b3e09527f.webm?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8321b19109ccb1b20c2d873b3e09527f.mp4?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/75b5831740cff98c7ed9c4330fb939c1.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/e13750a4a0b87df4eb8725aaf89e2f04.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interface is designed to focus on tactile items and icons rather than  menus and text, making it feel like part of the world. The UI in World of Anterra is both intuitive and fun to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/3b958367a10a700ab4462c28bdc38c20.poster.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/3b958367a10a700ab4462c28bdc38c20.webm?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/3b958367a10a700ab4462c28bdc38c20.mp4?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/75b5831740cff98c7ed9c4330fb939c1.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=68 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8531e865727c53d479da34b1300c217e.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% human made.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World of Anterra is a handcrafted open-world role playing adventure; featuring a non-linear story and quests, deep progression systems, fast and exciting grid-based combat, and rich lore, all wrapped in a satisfying and tactile interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/44356e81a9ea63c67065afb781b4ac7e.poster.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/44356e81a9ea63c67065afb781b4ac7e.webm?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/44356e81a9ea63c67065afb781b4ac7e.mp4?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 