ime actions with grid-based strategy. The UI is streamlined so simple encounters can be blasted through with ease. While skill and strategy is needed to conquer the game's more challenging foes; combining skill-based mechanics for attacking and defending, with special abilities, magic spells, crafted items, and strategic movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/ca549ae820f088280cf2ea847ed1c91a.poster.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/ca549ae820f088280cf2ea847ed1c91a.webm?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/ca549ae820f088280cf2ea847ed1c91a.mp4?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/75b5831740cff98c7ed9c4330fb939c1.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/7feea15be00b2149918192bb9cde9074.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World of Anterra blends hand-animated assets with player customization. Build your party members with a vast array of items and gear and see it all come to life with a custom animation layering system. This system also applies to NPCs and creatures creating a truly diverse and unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/cc99290cdff5bd8004c27613b08dbc3f.poster.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/cc99290cdff5bd8004c27613b08dbc3f.webm?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/cc99290cdff5bd8004c27613b08dbc3f.mp4?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/75b5831740cff98c7ed9c4330fb939c1.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/7d55fde03fbd725130423dc35f1cdc74.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World of Anterra comes to life with a custom real-time lighting engine, beautiful water shaders, dynamic weather, day-night cycles, and wonderful special effects that thoughtfully combine hand-animated sprites with procedural effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8321b19109ccb1b20c2d873b3e09527f.poster.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8321b19109ccb1b20c2d873b3e09527f.webm?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8321b19109ccb1b20c2d873b3e09527f.mp4?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/75b5831740cff98c7ed9c4330fb939c1.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/e13750a4a0b87df4eb8725aaf89e2f04.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interface is designed to focus on tactile items and icons rather than  menus and text, making it feel like part of the world. The UI in World of Anterra is both intuitive and fun to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/3b958367a10a700ab4462c28bdc38c20.poster.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/3b958367a10a700ab4462c28bdc38c20.webm?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/3b958367a10a700ab4462c28bdc38c20.mp4?t=1787685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/75b5831740cff98c7ed9c4330fb939c1.avif?t=1787685220\" width=920 height=68 /></span></p>", "short_description": "The prophecy foretold your coming, Traveller, but are you here to save Anterra or yourself? Explore an expansive living world, with thriving towns, wild animals, and monster filled dungeons. Discover secrets, lore and my